OL,3,AFive Russian military jets hit in
OL,4,Aairfield strike, says Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe airfield at Savasleyka, in Russia's
OL,7,FNizhny Novgorod region, has been a
OL,8,Ftarget for Ukraine for several years.
OL,9,FIt hosts aircraft used by Russia to
OL,10,Flaunch hypersonic missiles and glide
OL,11,Fbombs.
